Z||000000||noyb||05-07-2001||01:29 PM||||Just wondering if anyone would have a good idea what it would cost to ship a car from Phoenix, AZ. to Indiana?  I know I don't have a clue.||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroBert||05-07-2001||02:55 PM||||I shipped a car for my daughter from a dealer in Phoenix to another dealer in Indianapolis just about two years ago.  Total cost was $750 - took about three days (but I was the last one on the truck and the first on off.  Otherwise, it could take up to 3 weeks depending upon the firm and the route taken.)||||reg||1
Z||000002||84Bill||05-07-2001||03:11 PM||||I know Allied and some of the other major movers will move a car for you. I used to unload those trucks and they would accomidate a full sized car no problem along with the contents of an entire house!||||reg||3
